PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. TESTING OVERVIEW

Testing is performed to check whether the AI Fitness Plan system accepts user inputs correctly and generates suitable fitness recommendations.

2. TESTING OBJECTIVES

• To check user input handling.
• To verify the fitness recommendation process.
• To check different fitness goals.
• To identify and correct errors.

3. TEST CASES

Test Case 1
Input: General Fitness + Low intensity
Expected Result: A general fitness plan should be generated.

Test Case 2
Input: Strength + Low intensity
Expected Result: A strength-focused fitness plan should be generated.

Test Case 3
Input: Flexibility + Low intensity
Expected Result: A flexibility-focused fitness plan should be generated.

4. ACTUAL TESTING

The program was executed using different user inputs. The generated plans were checked to verify that the selected fitness goal produced the appropriate recommendations.

5. TESTING RESULT

The program executed successfully and generated fitness plans based on the selected user inputs.

6. OUTPUT EVIDENCE

Screenshots of the program execution and generated fitness plans are included as project evidence.

7. CONCLUSION

Testing confirms that the basic AI Fitness Plan program accepts user information and generates a suitable fitness plan based on the selected goal.
